  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Up & Out**: back after 65 archived shows (1222 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **The Dump**: back after 94 archived shows (1551 days); rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Break Out**: back after 148 archived shows (3195 days) [3]\n- **Relax**: back after 124 archived shows (2162 days); rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Remedy**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Steal Away**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Ragged & Dirty**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Who Knows What Tomorrow May Bring**: back after 30 archived shows (735 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2015-03-18.cmc622xt.sbd.matrix.flac24** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 14 songs; 120 min [1]\n- **soulive2015-03-18.cmc622xt.sbd.matrix.flac16**: matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 14 songs; 120 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The show was night 5 of the Bowlive VI run at Brooklyn Bowl [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2015-03-18.cmc622xt.sbd.matrix.flac24**: taped by Eric McRoberts; transferred by Eric McRoberts; source: On Stage Audience/SBD Matrix [1]. Also: Schoeps cmc622xt on-stage mics through Sonosax preamp and Apogee converter to a Sound Devices 744T, matrixed with the soundboard feed; Soundboard from a Digidesign/Avid Profile went by XLR into the 744T; both sources were time-aligned in SoundForge and mixed in Vegas Pro [1]\n- **soulive2015-03-18.cmc622xt.sbd.matrix.flac16**: taped by Eric McRoberts; transferred by Eric McRoberts; source: On Stage Audience/SBD Matrix [2]",
